{"id":"f2458da73bd8fe19","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-e-colored-node.md","title":"函数树的黑节点、白节点与灰节点","display":"df-e-colored-node — 函数树的黑节点、白节点与灰节点","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-e-colored-node","aliases":["20-df-e-colored-node"],"display":"df-e-colored-node — 函数树的黑节点、白节点与灰节点","chapter":"12","section":"12.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definitions 12.1.6–12.1.7","source_printed_pages":[198,199],"source_pdf_pages":[228,229],"depends_on":["[[20-df-e-splitting]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-e-colored-node"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-e-colored-node</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-e-colored-node — 函数树的黑节点、白节点与灰节点"},{"key":"chapter","html":"12"},{"key":"section","html":"12.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definitions 12.1.6–12.1.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>198</span><span>199</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>228</span><span>229</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" href=\"?note=5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" title=\"20-df-e-splitting\">20-df-e-splitting</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FTree}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{FTree}(T)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu=T(\\alpha)\\downarrow\">\\(\\nu=T(\\alpha)\\downarrow\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" href=\"?note=5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" title=\"20-df-e-splitting\">20-df-e-splitting</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\">\\(\\nu\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}e\\text{-}colored\\text{-}node}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{BlackNode}_e(\\nu,T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\neg\\exists\\rho,\\tau\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\ \\operatorname{ESplit}_e(\\rho,\\tau;\\nu,T),\\\\\n\\operatorname{WhiteNode}_e(\\nu,T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\alpha,\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n[T(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\nu\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\downarrow=\\rho\n\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown1)\\downarrow=\\tau\\land\\operatorname{ESplit}_e(\\rho,\\tau;\\nu,T)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Gray}(T,e)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(T)=2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\neg\\operatorname{EWhite}(T,e)\\land\\neg\\operatorname{EBlack}(T,e).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}e\\text{-}colored\\text{-}node}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{BlackNode}_e(\\nu,T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\neg\\exists\\rho,\\tau\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\ \\operatorname{ESplit}_e(\\rho,\\tau;\\nu,T),\\\\\n\\operatorname{WhiteNode}_e(\\nu,T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\alpha,\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n[T(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\nu\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\downarrow=\\rho\n\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown1)\\downarrow=\\tau\\land\\operatorname{ESplit}_e(\\rho,\\tau;\\nu,T)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Gray}(T,e)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(T)=2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\neg\\operatorname{EWhite}(T,e)\\land\\neg\\operatorname{EBlack}(T,e).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>白节点要求本函数树的直接两个子节点已实现分裂；黑节点断言整个程序值域内无分裂，不能用当前枚举前沿没有发现分裂来代替。树为灰不表示每个节点都灰。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 12.1.6–12.1.7；印刷页 198, 199；PDF 第 228, 229 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-e-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-e-splitting]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-e-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-e-splitting]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{FTree}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu=T(\\alpha)\\downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}e\\text{-}colored\\text{-}node}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{BlackNode}_e(\\nu,T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\neg\\exists\\rho,\\tau\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\ \\operatorname{ESplit}_e(\\rho,\\tau;\\nu,T),\\\\\n\\operatorname{WhiteNode}_e(\\nu,T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\alpha,\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}\\\n[T(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\nu\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\downarrow=\\rho\n\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown1)\\downarrow=\\tau\\land\\operatorname{ESplit}_e(\\rho,\\tau;\\nu,T)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Gray}(T,e)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(T)=2^{<\\omega}\\land\\neg\\operatorname{EWhite}(T,e)\\land\\neg\\operatorname{EBlack}(T,e).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1732,"backlinks":[{"id":"94da30522fe93e7f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05d82ffd170fb7a6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-e-colored-node]]；see [[20-df-K]]。"},{"id":"13e4a40da6a20a5c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-e-colored-node]]；see [[20-df-on-function-tree]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-e-colored-node]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-348","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-e-colored-node]] — 章 12；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-348","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-e-colored-node]]"}],"outgoing":["5c8fcd5a2bc3a582"]}